flowchart LR
    Studio[Appearance settings] --> Store[Local studio.json]
    Store --> Theme[Main window + overlay + floating dock]
    Dock[Nonactivating floating dock] --> Coordinator[Existing transcription coordinator]
    Coordinator --> ASR[Local speech recognition]
    ASR --> Raw[Original recognized utterance]
    Raw --> Match[Exact opt-in action cue]
    Match -->|Matched and validated| Open[macOS open: app or http/https URL]
    Match -->|No match| Output[Snippet / optional AI cleanup / local style output]
    Output --> Paste[Existing clipboard and paste]
    Wispr[Wispr local SQLite read-only] --> Preview[Library preview + fingerprint]
    Files[User-selected CSV or JSON] --> Preview
    Preview -->|Explicit apply| Library[Saved snippets + custom words]
    Preview -->|History opt-in| Archive[Separate text-only SQLite archive]
    Library --> Output
    Archive --> Reader[Paginated selectable text]
